From e10a37530852f86a5734abd9565e3afdf537212b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI-Lab <MiaAI-Lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:35:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] minimax_m3: config, tensor names, TP2 cuts and direct-I/O
 EXL3 loader (host only)

New family directory zig/src/families/minimax_m3 with config.zig (text_config plus
top-level quantization_config; only exl3, codebook mul1, out_scales always, version
1.6.1 or newer), names.zig (tensor-name map and parser), shard.zig (TP cut plan: kv
groups, index heads, 128-unit widths and vocabulary, empty ranks refused), load.zig
(header catalog read with direct I/O, per-rank admission plan, per-expert k2 arrays and
pointer offsets, Gemma 1+w fold, streamer that never maps a shard). Fixtures: config,
generation config, trimmed index (layers 0,3,17,18,46,59) and a shape table. Adds the
host-only build step test-minimax-load; no registration files are touched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
